{%- comment -%}
  CRO-12526 (v2) — Gallery wrapper.

  Reuses snippets/product-media-gallery-custom.liquid UNCHANGED — that
  snippet owns the Swiper main slider (.main-slider), the thumbnail
  Swiper (.thumbs-container) and the existing full-screen image viewer
  (the .zoomin state on .product-slider-holder, opened by the
  #product-slider-zoom trigger and closed by #swiper-button-close).
  Per spec the viewer pop-up must stay exactly as it is, so this wrapper
  only adds chrome around it:

  1. Promotional tag INSIDE the gallery, top-left over the main image —
     moved here from its control position above the product title.
     `best-seller-tag` snippet reused unchanged.
  2. "View all images" link below the thumbnails — cro-12526-v2-pdp.js
     forwards its click (and clicks on the main slide image) onto the
     existing #product-slider-zoom trigger.
  3. CSS-only restyle in cro-12526-v2-pdp.css: prev/next arrows hidden
     while NOT in .zoomin (the viewer itself keeps its arrows), black
     border on .swiper-slide-thumb-active, thumbnail row sizing.
  4. Swipe gestures are native Swiper behaviour — nothing to add.

  Mobile: the range/SKU meta block renders below the gallery here
  (context: 'mobile'), matching the spec.
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="cro12526v2-gallery">
  <div class="cro12526v2-gallery__tag">
    {%- render 'best-seller-tag' -%}
  </div>

  {%- comment -%}
    Round 17 (2026-08-25, client Round 2 #3): the theme snippet requests
    thumbnails at img_url:'100x' (100px wide) — fine for control's 61px
    thumbs, blurry once this build shows them 5-up at ~180×120 (and 2×
    DPR). The snippet is still reused UNCHANGED; its output is captured and
    only the "_100x." thumbnail size token is rewritten to "_400x."
    (main slides are 1001x/2002x and never contain "_100x."). Verified
    live: thumb src = .../COLETO-BK_100x.jpg?v=… — same file, larger render.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- capture cro12526v2_gallery_html -%}{% render 'product-media-gallery-custom' %}{%- endcapture -%}
  {{ cro12526v2_gallery_html | replace: '_100x.', '_400x.' }}

  <button type="button" class="cro12526v2-gallery__view-all" data-cro12526v2-view-all>
    <span class="cro12526v2-gallery__view-all-text">View all images</span>
    <svg class="cro12526v2-gallery__view-all-icon" width="20" height="8" viewBox="0 0 20 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M1 4H19M19 4L15.5 1M19 4L15.5 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
    </svg>
  </button>

  {%- render 'cro-12526-v2-breadcrumb-meta', context: 'mobile' -%}
</div>
